<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Acer six-month net profit up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Acer six-month net profit up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.80    vs     14.69</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     10.75    vs	8.87</p>
<p>    Turnover		   763.62    vs    511.04</p>
<p>    Investment income	  5.89    vs	2.33</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  24.13    vs     16.97</p>
<p>    Interest expense	   4.15    vs	2.24</p>
<p>    Pretax			17.52    vs     11.93</p>
<p>    Associates		   3.60    vs	7.26</p>
<p>    Tax			    2.76    vs	3.89</p>
<p>    Minorities		   0.56    vs	0.61</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    0.11    vs	0.18</p>
<p>Note - Acer Computer International Ltd is a unit of Taiwanese computer giant Acer inc.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65) 870-3080; Fax (65) 776-8112</p>
<p>-- Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
</text>
